{"type":"message","id":"ec5ab03e","parentId":"015eb1dc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T02:40:19.666Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-04-02 10:40 GMT+8] An async command did not run.\nDo not run the command again.\nThere is no new command output.\nDo not mention, summarize, or reuse output from any earlier run in this session.\n\nExact completion details:\nExec denied (gateway id=819ea1a2-7d70-4234-9a89-c4de58385e80, approval-timeout): set -euo pipefail\nrepo=openclaw/openclaw\nfor n in 54952 54964 55008 55013; do\n  echo \"===#$n===\"\n  timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/issues/$n --jq '{number:number,title:title,state:state,updated_at:updated_at,comments:comments,html_url:html_url}' || echo \"GH_API_FAILED:$n\"\n  echo \"--comments--\"\n  timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/issues/$n/comments --paginate --jq 'sort_by(.created_at) | reverse | .[:3] | map({user:.user.login,created_at,body})' || echo \"GH_COMMENTS_FAILED:$n\"\n  echo\n done\n\nReply to the user in a helpful way.\nExplain that the command did not run and why.\nDo not claim there is new command output."}],"timestamp":1775097619625}}
